---
const alumni = [
  { name: 'Nelson Mandela', role: 'Statesman & Nobel Peace Laureate' },
  { name: 'Patrice Motsepe', role: 'Founder, African Rainbow Minerals' },
  { name: 'Thuli Madonsela', role: 'Former Public Protector of South Africa' },
  { name: 'Cyril Ramaphosa', role: 'President of South Africa' },
];
---

<section
  id="why-campus"
  class="scroll-mt-4 bg-navy-deep px-[clamp(20px,5vw,56px)] py-[clamp(90px,14vh,160px)]"
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[980px]">
    <h2
      data-split
      class="mb-3 text-[clamp(34px,6vw,60px)] leading-[1.1] font-extrabold text-balance text-white"
    >
      World-changers have always walked through this campus.
    </h2>

    <span data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100" class="rule mt-[26px] mb-11"></span>

    <ul>
      {
        alumni.map((person, i) => (
          <li
            data-reveal
            data-reveal-delay={i * 80}
            class="group flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1.5 border-t border-white/15 py-5 last:border-b"
          >
            <span class="font-display text-[clamp(26px,4.5vw,40px)] leading-[1.15] font-bold text-gold transition-transform duration-400 ease-out-soft group-hover:translate-x-1.5">
              {person.name}
            </span>
            <span class="text-[14px] text-white/60 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-white/85">
              {person.role}
            </span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <p
      data-reveal
      class="mt-11 max-w-[52ch] text-[clamp(16px,2vw,20px)] leading-[1.65] text-white/90"
    >
      The next generation of presidents, founders and reformers is sitting in
      Wits lecture halls right now. That is why we are there, and why reaching
      them matters.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
